nsbench forced MoE routing for llama.cpp (llama-cpp-python 0.3.36, vendored llama.cpp
0c1e57098bba43ac29e6e3b677cdceebdd22334f). Apply inside the llama.cpp tree with `patch -p1`.

LLAMA_MOE_FORCE_ROUTING=fixed|disjoint replaces the router's top-k in build_moe_ffn with ids
from a graph input, the same ids as the hf hook (nsight_bench/compat/routing.py). Unset or
"natural": no input is created and the graph is unchanged. LLAMA_MOE_FORCE_ROUTING_DEBUG=1
prints each pass's ids to stderr. llama_nsbench_forced_routing() marks a patched build.
Built into ~/envs/nsbench-moeroute; checked by check_forced_routing_cpu.py next to this file.

